# VHS Quick Demo - Shorter version for README

# Terminal settings
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1400
Set Height 700
Set Padding 30
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

# Title
Type "# pull-vids - Download from 1000+ websites 🚀" Sleep 800ms Enter Sleep 1.5s

# Show version
Type "pull-vids --version" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 2s

# Example 1: YouTube
Type "# Download from YouTube" Sleep 300ms Enter
Type "pull-vids 'https://youtu.be/VIDEO_ID'" Sleep 300ms
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s

# Example 2: Audio
Type "# Extract audio as MP3" Sleep 300ms Enter
Type "pull-vids --audio 'https://youtu.be/VIDEO_ID'" Sleep 300ms
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s

# Example 3: Specific quality
Type "# Choose quality" Sleep 300ms Enter
Type "pull-vids --quality 1080p 'https://youtu.be/VIDEO_ID'" Sleep 300ms
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s

# Footer
Type "clear" Enter Sleep 500ms
Type "echo '✨ Free • Fast • 1000+ sites supported'" Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "echo 'github.com/vib795/pull-vids ⭐'" Enter
Sleep 3s

Output demo-quick.gif
